{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cenf3A7yoPi6NwnxkpDJb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```\nChanged\n  sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiError.kt — Added SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CONFIRMED error code for rejecting confirm requests on cancelled shipments.\n  sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt — Added POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint that moves CREATED shipments to CONFIRMED, succeeds idempotently on already-CONFIRMED shipments, rejects CANCELLED shipments with 409, and returns 404 for unknown ids.\n  sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt — Added 4 new tests (confirmations increased from 5 to 9 total).\n\nTests\n  `confirms a CREATED shipment and moves it to CONFIRMED` — Validates that a shipment in CREATED status transitions to CONFIRMED status and returns HTTP 200.\n  `confirming an already CONFIRMED shipment succeeds idempotently` — Validates that calling confirm twice on the same shipment succeeds both times without changing the status, ensuring operations can safely retry.\n  `confirming a CANCELLED shipment is rejected with 409` — Validates that attempting to confirm a CANCELLED shipment returns HTTP 409 Conflict with SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CONFIRMED error code.\n  `confirming a non-existent shipment is rejected with 404` — Validates that attempting to confirm a non-existent shipment returns HTTP 404 Not Found with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND error code.\n\nVerification\n  Command: ./mvnw test from sample-service/\n  Result: Tests run: 17, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0, BUILD SUCCESS. All existing tests (5 original shipment tests + 4 order tests + 1 app test + 3 customer tests) continue to pass; the 4 new confirm endpoint tests all pass.\n\nNot done\n  None. All requirements met: endpoint implemented with correct status transitions, idempotency, error handling for all scenarios, no new dependencies, no unrelated file changes.\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":318,"cache_read_input_tokens":27724,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":318,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018SGocBr1VQwvV8nAio1Ndo","session_id":"4b8de358-9b62-41bc-a342-d95735f82809","uuid":"6ff2c645-a53c-4336-ac58-86b40e807b27","timestamp":"2026-09-06T18:26:38.208Z","request_id":"req_011Cenf396xsFMwq3T2s8LZT","subagent_type":"implementer","task_description":"Implement confirm shipment endpoint"}
